{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44626","headline":"诗 十二 · 拾得","name":"诗 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男女爲婚嫁，俗务是常仪。\n自量其事力，何用广张施。\n取债夸人我，论情入骨痴。\n杀他鸡犬命，身死堕阿鼻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"拾得","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}